西替她整容了吧？小仙被她抓得生疼，急急地向一旁的凌风求救：“凌大哥，你就告诉小姐吧！”原来，二十年前，无悔老人曾爱上一个西夏国的女子，那女子长得国色天香，只可惜那女子是西夏圣女，不可以成婚。于是，两人偷偷私会，珠胎暗结，生下了一个女儿，西夏王大怒，暗地里处决了圣女，将他赶出西夏，并将他们的女儿选为新一代的圣女！小圣女长大后，一如她娘一样美丽无比，他曾偷偷地回去看过，可是，三年前，十六岁的圣女却突然暴毙。而无悔老人思女成疾，一夜之间白头如八旬老人，在将伍辰儿换心成功之后，又将伍辰儿的脸改成了自己女儿的模样！“原来是这样，看来这老头在我的身上还真是花了不少的心思！”媚儿唇角冷冷地一挑，当替身的感觉就跟被人利用差不多，她这辈子最恨的就是被人利用了！“小姐……”凌风正准备说什么，只听到外面传来走路的声音，面上一喜：“一定是师父回来了！”媚儿微微偏头看向门口，冷眉微微一扬，她倒要看看是什么样的老头，居然有这么大能耐，可以换心还能换面。“师父，您回来了！”凌风哈着腰开了门，那样子不像是恭敬更像是害怕。“嗯！”带着一身尘的老人大步跨了进来，神情甚为冷漠，不过，下一秒，看到媚儿时，他满是岁月痕迹的脸上居然展开了笑靥，皮皱皱的双手忍不住地颤抖着：“媚儿，你醒了？你终于醒了！”媚儿眉间紧了紧，抿了抿唇，切！她现在不但成了他女儿的模样，连名字居然也一模一样，这也太巧合了吧！“老头，别太激动！你比任何人都清楚，我不是你的女儿！”媚儿冷冷地话语将激动不已的老人拉回了现实当中，顷刻间，他的脸又恢复了刚才的冷漠，对一旁的凌风和小仙道：“你们都先出去！”“是！”两人都恭敬地退了出去。无悔老人缓缓地坐到媚儿面前，声音也变得十分的冷淡：“我该叫你辰妃娘娘，还是叫你伍辰儿呢？”媚儿眉眼一挑，唇角勾起淡淡的笑意：“不管是辰妃还是伍辰儿都已经死了，你可以叫我媚儿！”“媚儿？”看得出来，在说出这个名字时，他那双白多黑少深陷的眼里有着太多的激动，忽然他袖子一挥，桌子上的东西全数都扫到了地上：“你不可以叫媚儿！我不准你叫媚儿！”媚儿冷哼一声，毫不将他的怒气放在心上：“那真不好意思，我的名字就叫媚儿！”要她改名，门都没有！无悔老抚着胸口，似乎在努力平息着自己的怒气：“别忘了，你的命是我救回来的，我能救你，我也能毁了你！”宝贝们，喜欢的话，记得投票票支持哦，中秋节过后，每天两更哦～～", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The first man who hated the genocide said that his name was Ling Feng, and he was the apprentice of the master of Yaowang Valley, Old Man Wuhui. It was also Old Man Wuhui who used his millennium fox heart to resurrect Meier. After learning everything, Meier slowly accepted it and asked Xiaoxian to find a mirror. She wanted to see what she looked like now, but this look almost scared her enough to throw away the mirror in her hand. \"Here, how could this be me?\" The Wu Chen'er in my memory didn't look like this. He grabbed the little fairy next to him and said angrily: \"What did you do to my face?\" There shouldn't be any high-tech tools for her plastic surgery in this ancient time, right? Xiaoxian was in pain from being caught by her, and she hurriedly asked for help from Ling Feng: \"Brother Ling, just tell the lady!\" It turned out that twenty years ago, old man Wuhui fell in love with a woman from the Xixia Kingdom. The woman was very beautiful and fragrant. Unfortunately, the woman was a Xixia saint and could not get married. As a result, the two met secretly, had a secret knot, and gave birth to a daughter. The King of Xixia was furious, secretly executed the saint, drove him out of Xixia, and selected their daughter as the new generation of saint! When the little saint grew up, she was as beautiful as her mother. He once secretly went back to see her. However, three years ago, the sixteen-year-old saint died suddenly. The old man without regrets became ill because of longing for his daughter, and overnight he became as old as an eighty-year-old man. After successfully changing Wu Chen'er's heart, he changed Wu Chen'er's face to look like his own daughter! \"So that's it. It seems like this old man really put a lot of thought into me!\" Mei'er raised the corners of her lips coldly. Being a substitute feels like being used by others. What she hates most in her life is being used by others! \"Miss...\" Ling Feng was about to say something when he heard the sound of walking outside, and his face was filled with joy: \"Master must be back!\" Mei'er turned her head slightly and looked towards the door, raising her cold eyebrows slightly. She wanted to see what kind of old man he was, who had such great ability to change hearts and faces. \"Master, you're back!\" Ling Feng opened the door with a bow, looking more like fear than respect. \"Well!\" The old man covered in dust strode in with a very indifferent expression. However, the next second, when he saw Mei'er, a smile spread out on his face covered with traces of time, and his wrinkled hands couldn't help but tremble: \"Mei'er, are you awake? You're finally awake!\" Mei'er's brows tightened, and she pursed her lips, Tsk! Not only does she now look like his daughter, but her name is exactly the same. What a coincidence! \"Old man, don't be too excited! You know better than anyone else that I am not your daughter!\" Mei'er's cold words brought the excited old man back to reality. In an instant, his face returned to its previous indifference, and he said to Ling Feng and Xiaoxian beside him: \"You all get out first!\" \"Yes!\" Both of them retreated respectfully. Old Man Wuhui slowly sat in front of Mei'er, and his voice became very cold: \"Should I call you Concubine Chen, or Wu Chen'er?\" Meier raised her eyebrows, and a faint smile appeared on her lips: \"Both Concubine Chen and Wu Chen'er are dead, you can call me Mei'er!\" \"Mei'er?\" It can be seen that when she said this name, There was too much excitement in his deep-set eyes, which were more white than black. Suddenly, with a wave of his sleeve, everything on the table was swept to the floor: \"You can't call me Mei'er! I don't allow you to be called Mei'er!\" Mei'er snorted coldly, not taking his anger to heart: \"I'm sorry, my name is Mei'er!\" There is no way for her to change her name! Wuhui Lao stroked his chest, as if trying to calm down his anger: \"Don't forget, I saved your life. I can save you, but I can also destroy you!\" Darlings, if you like it, remember to vote for it. After the Mid-Autumn Festival, there will be two updates every day~~", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}